{
  "cell": "opamp_bias",
  "_comment": [
    "Cell descriptor for layout/bin/compose-cell.py (issue #204). See layout/opamp_bias/README.md.",
    "",
    "SCOPE: the bias/tail mirror of design/netlist/opamp_core.spice:",
    "  XMB1 nfet_01v8 W=7.820 L=1.2 m=1 (diode-connected reference, drain=gate=ibias)",
    "  XM5  nfet_01v8 W=7.820 L=1.2 m=2 (tail source, drain=tail, gate=ibias)",
    "Grid-legal width of DR-013. Not the full op-amp.",
    "",
    "MIRROR (block mb, klt gen mos_array 1x3, common_centroid, no dummies): three equal",
    "7.82 x 1.2 um units in one row, all in the same orientation. Order west to east",
    "is U1 | U0 | U2 with U0 = XMB1 (centre) and U1, U2 = XM5 (flanks): T B T.",
    "Both devices have their centroid at the array centre in x and the same y, so a",
    "linear gradient cancels to first order; the 1:2 ratio is unit count only.",
    "fe_masks (klt draw overlay) adds nsdm over the diffusions, a psdm ring over the",
    "p-tap ring, npc over the gate licons and the 0.15 um poly endcaps (both gate ends) the",
    "generator does not draw (klayout-tools#2934, #2936).",
    "",
    "ROUTING: vss li1 (source pads and ring TAP_W); tail met1 (outer drains, bus at",
    "y=-2.0 below the ring); ibias met1 (centre drain up x=4.27 to a gate bus at y=9.0",
    "tying all three gates, west to the pin)."
  ],
